  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Resilience, Early Action, Adaptation and Inclusion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component will empower communities to establish localised, sustainable mechanisms for resilience building, adaptation and early warning and early action, and inclusion. This will include supporting strong participation of communities in the design, implementation of local development plans that integrate adaptation and resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
